hadiths[57]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1408","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do kalimey zabaan par halkay hain, meezaan mein bhaari hain, Rehman ko mehboob hain: Subhan Allahi wa bihamdihi, Subhan Allahil Azeem. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1409","Unhin se (Raziallahu anhu) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mera kehna: Subhan Allah, aur Alhamdolillah, aur La ilaha illallah, aur Allahu Akbar, mujhey us se zyada mehboob hai jis par suraj tuloo hota hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1410","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs din mein sau martaba kahey: Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai uska koi shareek nahi, usi key liye baadshahat hai aur usi key liye hamd hai, aur wo har chiz par qaadir hai, to uske liye das gardanon key barabar hoga aur uske liye sau nekiyan likhi jaengi, aur us se sau buraiyan mita di jaengi, aur wo uskey liye us din shaam tak shaitaan se hifaazat hoga, aur koi us se behtar lekar na aayega siwaey us aadmi key jis ne us se zyada amal kya. Aur farmaya: Jo shakhs din mein sau martaba Subhan Allahi wa bihamdihi kahey to uski khataein mita di jaengi chaahey samundar key jhaag key barabar hon. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1411","Abu Ayyub Ansaari (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs das martaba kahey: Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai uska koi shareek nahi, usi key liye baadshahat hai aur usi key liye hamd hai, aur wo har chiz par qaadir hai, to wo aisa hai jaisa us ne Aulaad-e-Ismaeel mein se chaar jaanon ko aazaad kya. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1412","Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasul (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Kya main tumhey Allah key nazdeek sab se mehboob kalaam na bataun? Beshak Allah key nazdeek sab se mehboob kalaam hai: Subhan Allahi wa bihamdihi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1413","Abu Maalik Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Paaki imaan ka aadha hai, aur Alhamdolillah meezaan ko bhar deta hai, aur Subhan Allah aur Alhamdolillah bhar detey hain, ya bharta hai, aasmaanon aur zameen key darmiyaan ko. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1414","Saad bin Abi Waqqas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik dehaati Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Mujhey aisa kalaam sikhaein jo main kahun. Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai uska koi shareek nahi, Allah bahut bara hai aur Allah key liye bahut zyada hamd hai aur Allah paak hai jo jahaanon ka Rab hai, aur na koi taqat aur na koi quwwat magar Allah Aziz Hakeem ki taufeeq se. Us ne kaha: To ye merey Rab key liye hain, to merey liye kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah! Mujhey bakhsh dey aur mujh par rehem farma aur mujhey hidayat dey aur mujhey rizq ata farma. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1415","Saubaan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab apni namaz se farigh hotey to teen martaba maghfirat maangtey aur farmatey: Ae Allah! Tu salaam hai aur Tujh hi se salaamti hai, Tu barkat wala hai ae jalal aur izzat waley. Auzai se, jo hadis key aik rawi hain, poochha gaya ke istighfaar kaisey hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Kehta hai: Main Allah se maghfirat maangta hun, main Allah se maghfirat maangta hun. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1416","Mugheera bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab namaz se farigh hotey aur salaam phertey to farmatey: Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai uska koi shareek nahi, usi key liye baadshahat hai aur usi key liye hamd hai, aur wo har chiz par qaadir hai. Ae Allah! Jo Tune diya usey koi rokne wala nahi, aur jo Tune roka usey koi dene wala nahi, aur kisi dolat waley ko Teri taraf se dolat faeda nahi degi. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1417","Abdullah Ibn Az-Zubair (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo har namaz key peechey salaam phertey waqt kehtey they: Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai uska koi shareek nahi, usi key liye baadshahat hai aur usi key liye hamd hai, aur wo har chiz par qaadir hai. Na koi taqat aur na koi quwwat magar Allah ki taufeeq se. Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi aur ham usi ki ibaadat kartey hain, usi key liye naimat hai aur usi key liye fazl hai aur usi key liye achchhi sana hai. Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi jabke ham usi key liye deen ko khaalis karne waley hain chaahey kaafir napasand karein. Ibn Az-Zubair ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) har namaz key peechey in key sath tehleel farmatey they. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1418","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke muhaajireen key fuqara Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aey aur unhon-ne kaha: Maaldaar buland darjaat aur hamesha ki naimat ley gaey: Wo namaz padhtey hain jaisey ham padhtey hain, aur rozey rakhtey hain jaisey ham rakhtey hain, aur unhey maalon ka fazl hai: Wo Hajj kartey hain aur Umrah kartey hain aur jihad kartey hain aur sadqa kartey hain. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya main tumhey aisi chiz na sikhaun jis se tum unhey pa lo jo tum se aagey badh gaey aur un se aagey badh jao jo tumharey baad hain, aur tum se afzal koi na ho siwaey uskey jis ne waisa kya jaisa tum ne kya? Unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya: Har namaz key peechey tai tees martaba tasbeeh karo aur hamd karo aur takbeer kaho. Abu Saalih jo Abu Hurairah se rawi hain, jab un se unkey kehney ki kaifiyat key baarey mein poochha gaya to unhon-ne kaha: Kehta hai: Subhan Allah, aur Alhamdolillah, aur Allahu Akbar, yahan tak ke un sab mein se tai tees ho jaein. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ne apni riwayat mein izafa kya hai: To muhaajireen key fuqara Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas wapas aey aur unhon-ne kaha: Hamarey maaldaar bhaiyon ne hamarey amal key baarey mein suna aur unhon-ne waisa kya? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ye Allah ka fazl hai jisey chahta hai deta hai. Ad-dusoor daal key fatha aur saalisa key sukoon key sath dasr ki jama hai aur wo bahut maal hai."
"1419","Unhin se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs har namaz key peechey tai tees martaba Allah ki tasbeeh karey aur tai tees martaba Allah ki hamd karey aur tai tees martaba Allah ki takbeer kahey, aur sau poori kartey huey kahey: Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai uska koi shareek nahi, usi key liye baadshahat hai aur usi key liye hamd hai, aur wo har chiz par qaadir hai, to uski khataein bakhsh di jaengi chaahey samundar key jhaag key barabar hon. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1420","Kaab bin Ujra (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Peechey aaney waley kalimaat hain jinka kehne wala, ya karne wala, har farz namaz key peechey naakaam nahi hoga: Tai tees tasbeehein aur tai tees tahmeedein aur chauti s takbeerein. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1421","Saad bin Abi Waqqas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) namazon key peechey in kalimaat key sath panah maangtey they: Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri panah maangta hun buzdili aur kanjoosi se, aur Teri panah maangta hun is se ke zaleel umr ki taraf lautaya jaun, aur Teri panah maangta hun duniya key fitney se, aur Teri panah maangta hun qabr key fitney se. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1422","Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka haath pakda aur farmaya: Ae Muaz! Allah ki qasam! Beshak main tum se mohabbat karta hun. To farmaya: Ae Muaz! Main tumhey waseeyat karta hun ke har namaz key peechey ye kehna na chhoro: Ae Allah! Meri madad farma Terey zikr par aur Terey shukr par aur Teri achchhi ibaadat par. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1423","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi tashahhud padhey to chaar se Allah ki panah maangey aur kahey: Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri panah maangta hun dozakh key azaab se, aur qabr key azaab se, aur zindagi aur maut key fitney se, aur Masih Dajjaal key fitney key shar se. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1424","Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab namaz key liye khadey hotey to tashahhud aur salaam key darmiyaan Aap key aakhri kalaam mein se hota: Ae Allah! Mujhey bakhsh dey jo main ne aagey bheja aur jo peechey kya, aur jo chhupaya aur jo zaahir kya, aur jo hadd se badha, aur jo Tu mujh se zyada jaanne wala hai. Tu hi aagey karne wala hai aur Tu hi peechey karne wala hai, Terey siwa koi mabood nahi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1425","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne ruku aur sajdey mein kasrat se kehtey they: Tu paak hai ae Allah ae hamarey Rab aur Teri hamd key sath, ae Allah mujhey bakhsh dey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1426","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne ruku aur sajdey mein kehtey they: Bahut paak bahut muqaddas farishton aur Rooh key Rab. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1427","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Raha ruku to us mein Rab ki buzrugi bayan karo, aur raha sajda to us mein dua mein koshish karo, kyonke laaiq hai ke tumharey liye qabool ki jaey. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1428","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Banda apne Rab se sab se zyada qareeb hota hai jab wo sajdey mein hota hai, isliye kasrat se dua karo. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1429","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne sajdey mein kehtey they: Ae Allah! Mera saara gunah bakhsh dey, chhota aur bara, aur pehla aur aakhri, aur zaahir aur posheeda. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1430","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne aik raat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko na paaya to taalaash kya, to Aap ruku, ya sajdey mein they aur farma rahey they: Tu paak hai aur Teri hamd key sath, Terey siwa koi mabood nahi. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: To mera haath Aap key qadmon key pait par pada jabke Aap masjid mein they aur wo donon khadey they, aur Aap farma rahey they: Ae Allah! Beshak main Teri raza key sath Teri naraazgi se panah maangta hun, aur Terey darguzar key sath Terey azaab se, aur Tujh se Teri panah maangta hun. Main Teri sana shumaar nahi kar sakta, Tu waisa hai jaisa Tune apni zaat ki sana ki hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1431","Saad bin Abi Waqqas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas they to Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum mein se koi aajiz hai ke har din hazaar neki kamaey! To unkey humnasheenon mein se aik saail ne poochha: Hazaar neki kaisey kamayega? Aap ne farmaya: Sau tasbeehein kahey to uskey liye hazaar neki likhi jaegi ya us se hazaar khata mita di jaegi. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Humaidi ne kaha: Sahih Muslim mein is tarah hai: au yahutta. Barqaani ne kaha: Aur Shoba aur Abu Awaana ne riwayat kya hai."
"1432","Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se har aik key har jor par subah sadqa hai: To har tasbeeh sadqa hai, aur har tahmeed sadqa hai, aur har tehleel sadqa hai, aur har takbeer sadqa hai, aur bhalai ka hukm sadqa hai, aur burai se rokna sadqa hai, aur iski taraf se do rakaatein kaafi hain jo chaasht key waqt padhta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1433","Ummul Momineen Juwairiya bint Al-Haaris (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unkey paas se subah key waqt nikley jab Aap ne subah ki namaz padhi thi jabke wo apni jaey namaz mein thein, phir wapas aey chaasht key baad jabke wo baithi hui thein. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum usi haalat par ho jis par main tumhey chhor gaya tha? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. To Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main ne tumharey baad chaar kalimey teen martaba kahey hain, agar unhey taula jaey us key sath jo tum ne aaj key din se kaha hai to wo bhaari hongey: Allah paak hai apni hamd key sath apni makhlooq ki ginti key barabar, aur apni raza key barabar, aur apne arsh key wazan key barabar, aur apne kalimaat ki siyaahi key barabar. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur unki aik riwayat mein hai: Allah paak hai apni makhlooq ki ginti key barabar, Allah paak hai apni raza key barabar, Allah paak hai apne arsh key wazan key barabar, Allah paak hai apne kalimaat ki siyaahi key barabar. Aur Tirmizi ki riwayat mein hai: Kya main tumhey aise kalimey na sikhaun jo tum kaho? Allah paak hai apni makhlooq ki ginti key barabar, Allah paak hai apni makhlooq ki ginti key barabar, Allah paak hai apni makhlooq ki ginti key barabar, Allah paak hai apni raza key barabar, Allah paak hai apni raza key barabar, Allah paak hai apni raza key barabar, Allah paak hai apne arsh key wazan key barabar, Allah paak hai apne arsh key wazan key barabar, Allah paak hai apne arsh key wazan key barabar, Allah paak hai apne kalimaat ki siyaahi key barabar, Allah paak hai apne kalimaat ki siyaahi key barabar, Allah paak hai apne kalimaat ki siyaahi key barabar."
"1434","Abu Musa Ashari (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Uski misaal jo apne Rab ka zikr karta hai aur jo uska zikr nahi karta, zinda aur murda ki si hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai. Aur Muslim ne riwayat kya hai aur farmaya: Us ghar ki misaal jis mein Allah ka zikr kya jata hai aur us ghar ki jis mein Allah ka zikr nahi kya jata, zinda aur murda ki si hai."
"1435","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Taala farmata hai: Main apne bandey key gumaan key paas hun jo wo mujh se rakhta hai, aur main uskey sath hun jab wo mujhey yaad karta hai. Phir agar wo mujhey apne dil mein yaad karey to main usey apne dil mein yaad karta hun, aur agar wo mujhey majlis mein yaad karey to main usey us se behtar majlis mein yaad karta hun. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1436","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mufridoon sabqat ley gaey. Unhon-ne kaha: Mufridoon kaun hain ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Allah ka kasrat se zikr karne waley mard aur aurtein. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai. Aur riwayat kya gaya: Mufridoon ra key tashdeed aur takhfeef key sath, aur mashhoor jo jamhoor ne kaha hai tashdeed hai."
"1437","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Afzal zikr hai: La ilaha illallah. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1438","Abdullah bin Busr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke aik aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Islam ki shariyatein mujh par bahut ho gai hain, isliye mujhey aisi chiz bataein jisey main mazboot pakdun. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhari zabaan Allah key zikr se hamesha tar rahey. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1439","Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs kahey: Subhan Allahi wa bihamdihi, to uskey liye Jannat mein khajoor ka darakht lagaya jata hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1440","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main Ibrahim (Alehis salaam) se mila us raat jab mujhey Meraj karai gai, to unhon-ne kaha: Ae Muhammad! Apni ummat ko meri taraf se salaam pahunchayo aur unhey khabar do ke Jannat ki matti pakeeza hai aur uska pani meetha hai, aur wo chatyal maidan hai, aur uski kheti hai: Subhan Allah, aur Alhamdolillah, aur La ilaha illallah, aur Allahu Akbar. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1441","Abud Darda (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya main tumhey tumharey aamaal mein sab se behtar na bataun, aur tumharey Baadshah key nazdeek sab se paakiza, aur tumharey darjaat mein sab se buland, aur tumharey liye soney chaandi kharch karne se behtar, aur tumharey liye is se behtar ke tum apne dushman se milo aur unki gardaney maaro aur wo tumhari gardaney maarein? Unhon-ne kaha: Kyun nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Allah Taala ka zikr. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur Haakim Abu Abdullah ne kaha: Uski sanad sahih hai."
"1442","Saad bin Abi Waqqas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath aik aurat key paas dakhil huey jabke uskey saamney guthliyan, ya kankariyan thein jin se wo tasbeeh karti thi. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya main tumhey us se aasaan, ya afzal na bataun? To farmaya: Subhan Allah aasmaan mein jo paida kya uski ginti key barabar, aur Subhan Allah zameen mein jo paida kya uski ginti key barabar, aur Subhan Allah jo uskey darmiyaan hai uski ginti key barabar, aur Subhan Allah jo wo paida karne wala hai uski ginti key barabar, aur Allahu Akbar isi tarah, aur Alhamdolillah isi tarah, aur La ilaha illallah isi tarah, aur La haula wa la quwwata illa billah isi tarah. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1443","Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Kya main tumhey Jannat key khazanon mein se aik khazana na bataun? To main ne kaha: Kyun nahi ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya: La haula wa la quwwata illa billah. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1444","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne har waqt mein Allah Taala ka zikr farmatey they. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1445","Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum mein se koi apni biwi key paas aey to kahey: Allah key naam se, ae Allah! Hamein shaitaan se door rakh aur shaitaan ko us se door rakh jo Tune hamein ata kya. Phir un donon key darmiyaan bachcha muqaddar kya gaya to usey nuqsaan nahi pahunchayega. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1446","Huzaifa aur Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab apne bistar par aatey to farmatey: Terey naam key sath ae Allah main marta hun aur jeeta hun. Aur jab bedaar hotey to farmatey: Tamam tareefein Allah key liye hain jis ne hamein maut key baad zinda kya aur usi ki taraf uthna hai. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1447","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Taala key farishtey hain jo raaston mein phirtey hain aur Ahle Zikr ko talaash kartey hain. Phir jab wo aisi qaum ko paatey hain jo Allah Azza wa Jall ka zikr karti hai to pukaartey hain: Apni haajat ki taraf aao. To wo unhey apne paron se aasmaane duniya tak gher letey hain. To unka Rab un se poochhta hai, jabke wo zyada jaanne wala hai: Merey bandey kya kehtey hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo kehtey hain: Wo Teri tasbeeh kartey hain aur Teri takbeer kehtey hain aur Teri hamd kartey hain aur Teri buzrugi bayan kartey hain. To Allah farmata hai: Kya unhon-ne Mujhey dekha hai? To wo kehtey hain: Nahi, Allah ki qasam unhon-ne Tujhey nahi dekha. To Allah farmata hai: Agar wo Mujhey dekh letey to kaisey hotey?! Unhon-ne kaha: Wo kehtey hain: Agar wo Tujhey dekhtey to Teri ibaadat mein zyada shadeed hotey aur Teri buzrugi mein zyada shadeed hotey aur Teri tasbeeh mein zyada hotey. To Allah farmata hai: To wo kya maangtey hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo kehtey hain: Wo Tujh se Jannat maangtey hain. Unhon-ne kaha: Allah farmata hai: Aur kya unhon-ne usey dekha hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo kehtey hain: Nahi Allah ki qasam ae Rab unhon-ne usey nahi dekha. Unhon-ne kaha: Allah farmata hai: To agar wo usey dekh letey to kaisey hotey?! Unhon-ne kaha: Wo kehtey hain: Agar wo usey dekhtey to us par zyada harees hotey aur uski talab mein zyada shadeed hotey aur us mein zyada raghbat rakhtey. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo kis se panah maangtey hain? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo kehtey hain: Dozakh se panah maangtey hain. Unhon-ne kaha: To Allah farmata hai: Aur kya unhon-ne usey dekha hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Wo kehtey hain: Nahi Allah ki qasam unhon-ne usey nahi dekha. To Allah farmata hai: Agar wo usey dekh letey to kaisey hotey?! Unhon-ne kaha: Wo kehtey hain: Agar wo usey dekhtey to us se zyada bhaagney waley hotey aur us se zyada darne waley hotey. Unhon-ne kaha: Allah farmata hai: To main tumhey gawaah karta hun ke main ne unhey bakhsh diya. Unhon-ne kaha: Farishton mein se aik farishta kehta hai: Un mein fulaan hai jo un mein se nahi hai, wo to haajat key liye aaya tha. Allah farmata hai: Wo humnasheen hain jinka humnasheen badbakht nahi hota. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah key ghoomney waley fazl waley farishtey hain jo zikr ki majlison ko talaash kartey hain. Phir jab wo aisi majlis ko paatey hain jis mein zikr hai to unkey sath baith jaatey hain aur baaz baaz ko apne paron se gher letey hain yahan tak ke unkey aur aasmaane duniya key darmiyaan ko bhar detey hain. Phir jab muntashir hotey hain to chadhtey hain aur aasmaan ki taraf jaatey hain. To Allah Azza wa Jall un se poochhta hai, jabke wo zyada jaanne wala hai: Tum kahan se aey? To wo kehtey hain: Ham zameen mein Terey bandon key paas se aey hain: Wo Teri tasbeeh kartey hain aur Teri takbeer kehtey hain aur Teri tehleel kartey hain aur Teri hamd kartey hain aur Tujh se maangtey hain. Allah farmata hai: Aur wo mujh se kya maangtey hain? Wo kehtey hain: Wo Tujh se Teri Jannat maangtey hain. Allah farmata hai: Aur kya unhon-ne meri Jannat dekhi hai? Wo kehtey hain: Nahi ae Rab. Allah farmata hai: To agar wo meri Jannat dekh letey to kaisey hotey?! Wo kehtey hain: Aur Teri panah maangtey hain. Allah farmata hai: Aur kis se meri panah maangtey hain? Wo kehtey hain: Teri aag se ae Rab. Allah farmata hai: Aur kya unhon-ne meri aag dekhi hai? Wo kehtey hain: Nahi. Allah farmata hai: To agar wo meri aag dekh letey to kaisey hotey? Wo kehtey hain: Aur Tujh se maghfirat maangtey hain. To Allah farmata hai: Main ne unhey bakhsh diya aur unhey wo diya jo unhon-ne maanga aur unhey us se panah di jis se unhon-ne panah maangi. Unhon-ne kaha: To wo kehtey hain: Ae Rab! Un mein fulaan gunahgaar banda hai jo guzra tha aur unkey sath baith gaya tha. To Allah farmata hai: Aur usey bhi bakhsh diya, wo qaum hain jinka humnasheen badbakht nahi hota."
"1448","Unhin se aur Abu Saeed (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi qaum Allah Azza wa Jall ka zikr karti hui nahi baith-ti magar farishtey unhey gher letey hain aur rehmat unhey dhaanp leti hai aur un par sukoon naazil hota hai aur Allah unhey unkey paas walon mein yaad farmata hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1449","Abu Waaqid Al-Haaris bin Auf (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab masjid mein baithey huey they aur log Aap key sath they ke do aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf aey aur aik chala gaya. To wo donon Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par khadey huey. To un mein se aik ne halqey mein jagah dekhi to us mein baith gaya, aur doosra unkey peechey baith gaya, aur teesra peeth pher kar chala gaya. Phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farigh huey to farmaya: Kya main tumhey teen aadmiyon key baarey mein na bataun: Un mein se aik ne Allah ki taraf panah li to Allah ne usey panah di, aur doosre ne haya ki to Allah ne us se haya ki, aur teesre ne munh phera to Allah ne us se munh phera. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1450","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) masjid mein aik halqey par nikley aur farmaya: Tumhey kis ne bithaya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Ham Allah ka zikr karne baithey hain. Unhon-ne kaha: Kya Allah ki qasam tumhey sirf isi ne bithaya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Hamein sirf isi ne bithaya hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Khabardaar! Beshak main ne tum se tum par tohmat ki wjah se qasam nahi li, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas merey martabey wala mujh se kam hadis bayan karne wala koi na tha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne sahaaba key aik halqey par nikley aur farmaya: Tumhey kis ne bithaya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Ham Allah ka zikr karne baithey hain aur uski hamd kartey hain us par jo us ne hamein Islam ki hidayat di aur ham par ehsaan kya. Aap ne farmaya: Kya Allah ki qasam tumhey sirf isi ne bithaya hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Allah ki qasam hamein sirf isi ne bithaya hai. Aap ne farmaya: Khabardaar! Beshak main ne tum se tum par tohmat ki wjah se qasam nahi li, lekin Jibraeel merey paas aey aur mujhey khabar di ke Allah tumharey sath farishton par fakhr farmata hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1451","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs subah aur shaam key waqt Subhan Allahi wa bihamdihi sau martaba kahey to qayamat key din koi us se behtar lekar na aayega siwaey uskey jis ne waisa kaha jaisa us ne kaha ya izafa kya. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1452","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Bichhu ne mujhey kal raat kaat liya! Aap ne farmaya: Khabardaar! Agar tum shaam key waqt kehtey: Main Allah key kaamil kalimaat ki panah maangta hun us shar se jo us ne paida kya, to wo tumhey nuqsaan na pahunchata. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1453","Unhin se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap subah key waqt kehtey they: Ae Allah! Terey sath ham ne subah ki aur Terey sath ham ne shaam ki, aur Terey sath ham jeetey hain aur Terey sath ham martey hain, aur Teri taraf uthna hai. Aur jab shaam kartey to farmatey: Ae Allah! Terey sath ham ne shaam ki, aur Terey sath ham jeetey hain aur Terey sath ham martey hain, aur Teri taraf laut-na hai. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1454","Unhin se riwayat hai ke Abu Bakr Siddiq (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhey aise kalimaat ka hukm dein jo main subah aur shaam kahun. Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Ae Allah! Aasmaanon aur zameen key paida karne waley, ghaib aur haazir key jaanne waley, har chiz key Rab aur maalik! Main gawahi deta hun ke Terey siwa koi mabood nahi. Main Terey sath apne nafs key shar se aur shaitaan key shar aur uskey shirk se panah maangta hun. Aap ne farmaya: Usey kaho jab tum subah karo aur jab shaam karo aur jab apna bistar pakdo. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1455","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab shaam kartey to farmatey: Ham ne shaam ki aur baadshahat ne Allah key liye shaam ki, aur tamam tareefein Allah key liye hain. Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, wo akela hai uska koi shareek nahi. Rawi ne kaha: Mera khayaal hai ke unhon-ne un mein kaha: Usi key liye baadshahat hai aur usi key liye hamd hai aur wo har chiz par qaadir hai. Ae Rab! Main Tujh se is raat mein jo bhalai hai aur uskey baad jo hai uska sawal karta hun, aur Teri panah maangta hun is raat mein jo shar hai aur uskey baad jo hai us se. Ae Rab! Main Teri panah maangta hun susti se aur takabbur ki burai se. Ae Rab! Main Teri panah maangta hun is raat mein jo shar hai, aur uskey baad jo bhalai hai, aur Teri panah maangta hun is raat mein jo shar hai aur uskey baad jo hai us se. Ae Rab! Main Teri panah maangta hun susti se aur takabbur ki burai se. Ae Rab! Main Teri panah maangta hun dozakh key azaab se aur qabr mein azaab se. Aur jab subah kartey to yehi kehtey: Ham ne subah ki aur baadshahat ne Allah key liye subah ki. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1456","Abdullah bin Khubaib, kha muqta muqta key zamma key sath, (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Padh: Qul huwallahu ahad aur Muawwizatain, shaam aur subah key waqt teen martaba, wo tumhey har chiz se kaafi hongi. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1457","Usman bin Affan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo banda har din ki subah aur har raat ki shaam mein teen martaba kahey: Allah key naam key sath jiskey naam key sath zameen aur aasmaan mein koi chiz nuqsaan nahi pahunchati aur wo sunney wala jaanne wala hai, to usey koi chiz nuqsaan nahi pahunchayegi. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1458","Huzaifa aur Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab apne bistar par aatey to farmatey: Terey naam key sath ae Allah main jeeta hun aur marta hun. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1459","Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se aur Faatima (Raziallahu anhuma) se farmaya: Jab tum donon apne bistar par aao, ya jab tum donon apna bistar pakdo, to tai tees martaba takbeer kaho, aur tai tees martaba tasbeeh karo, aur tai tees martaba hamd karo. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Tasbeeh chauti s martaba. Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Takbeer chauti s martaba. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1460","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne bistar par aey to apne tehband key andaruni hissey se apna bistar jhaadey kyonke wo nahi jaanta ke uskey peechey us par kya hai, phir kahey: Terey naam key sath ae merey Rab main ne apna pehlu rakha aur Terey sath usey uthata hun. Agar Tu meri jaan rok ley to us par rehem farma, aur agar usey chhor dey to uski hifaazat farma jis key sath Tu apne naik bandon ki hifaazat farmata hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1461","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab apna bistar pakadtey to apne donon haathon mein phunkaartey aur Muawwizaat padhtey aur un donon se apne jism ka masah kartey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Aur un donon ki aik riwayat mein hai: Ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab har raat apne bistar par aatey to apni donon hatheliyan jama kartey phir un donon mein phunkaartey aur un donon mein padhtey: Qul huwallahu ahad, aur Qul a'oozu birabbil falaq, aur Qul a'oozu birabbin naas, phir un donon se apne jism ka jitna ho sakta masah kartey, un donon se apne sar aur chehrey par shuru kartey aur apne jism key saamney waley hissey par, ye teen martaba kartey. (Muttafaqun aleh). Ahl-e-lughat ne kaha: Nafs halka phunka hai baghair thook key."
"1462","Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Jab tum apne bistar par aao to namaz key wuzu ki tarah wuzu karo, phir daayein pehlu par late jao aur kaho: Ae Allah! Main ne apni jaan Terey supurd ki aur apna chehra Teri taraf mutawajjah kya aur apna muamla Terey hawale kya aur apni peeth Teri taraf jhukai, Teri taraf raghbat aur khauf key sath. Tujh se bachney key liye Terey siwa koi panah aur nijaat nahi. Main Teri kitaab par imaan laya jo Tune naazil ki aur Terey Nabi par jo Tune bheja. Phir agar tum mar gaey to fitrat par marogey, aur inhey apna aakhri kalaam banao. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1463","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab apne bistar par aatey to farmatey: Tamam tareefein Allah key liye hain jis ne hamein khilaya aur pilaya, aur hamein kaafi hua aur hamein thikana diya, to kitney hain jinka na koi kaafi hai aur na koi thikana! Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1464","Huzaifa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab soney ka irada farmatey to apna daayaan haath apne rukhsaar key neechey rakhtey, phir farmatey: Ae Allah! Mujhey apne azaab se bacha jis din Tu apne bandon ko uthayega. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai. Aur ise Abu Dawud ne Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ki riwayat se naql kya hai aur us mein hai ke Aap usey teen martaba kehtey they."
